{"availability":"available","full":"BbekShr/mayacharts","name":"mayacharts","description":"Beautiful, accessible charts in five lines. Zero dependencies. The browser is the chart engine.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-04T01:28:51Z","updated":"2026-10-11T02:08:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bbekshr.github.io/mayacharts/","topics":["accessibility","chart-library","charts","csp","custom-elements","data-visualization","dataviz","heatmap","javascript","sankey","ssr","svg","treemap","trusted-types","typescript","wcag","web-components","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://bbekshr.github.io/mayacharts/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:09.851Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:09.851Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:09.851Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:10:09.851Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Twenty-seven chart types from one JSON spec. About 56 KB, zero dependencies, accessible and server-rendered by default.","Website · Gallery · Builder · A million rows · Docs · ♥ Support"],"features":["Small. Twelve chart types with tooltips, drill, zoom, selection and animation in about 56 KB gzip, with no runtime dependencies. Fifteen more types (treemap, sunburst, sankey, chord, marimekko, waffle, radial, gauge,…","Passes the enterprise checklist. Works under a strict CSP with Trusted Types, meets WCAG 2.2 AA (axe-clean in light and dark), supports RTL, and every user-visible string is localisable.","Renders on the server. render(spec) is a pure function that returns an SVG string in Node or any runtime without a DOM. renderShell returns a full chart that works before any JavaScript loads.","One JSON spec. No callbacks in the config, so a spec can be stored in a database, sent over the wire, or written by an LLM. A JSON Schema and llms.txt ship with the package.","Any framework, or none. It is a custom element, so it works in React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, Astro and plain HTML."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BbekShr/mayacharts/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"efa749712d3a869711dc8ff49db57e7cec34800c737642fa9aeb090b32f48423","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.129Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.129Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Twenty-seven chart types from one JSON spec. About 56 KB, zero dependencies, accessible and server-rendered by default.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BbekShr/mayacharts/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"efa749712d3a869711dc8ff49db57e7cec34800c737642fa9aeb090b32f48423","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BbekShr/mayacharts/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.129Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T02:08:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BbekShr/mayacharts/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.130Z","hash":"efa749712d3a869711dc8ff49db57e7cec34800c737642fa9aeb090b32f48423","originalBytes":74957,"storedBytes":74957,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["mayacharts","data","bar","type","value","series","one","chart","revenue","import","json","line","units","field","category","area","spec","axis","each","month","orbit","row","table","true","constellation","core","region","tooltip","per","rows","sales","const","every","scatter","waffle","weave","dumbbell","product","time","types","css","kpi","legend","light","radial","boolean","element","text","total","treemap","drill","format","html","over","same","string","year","array","bars","boxplot","categories","chart.spec","currency","dark","heatmap","size","theme","width","custom","default","dot","first","full","funnel","gauge","grid","growth","labels","marimekko","name","npm","other","sunburst","without","any","beeswarm","charts","hexmap","output","parallel","path","see","set","support","target","values","waterfall","zoom","chord","colours"